WEBVTT

00:03:28.914 --> 00:03:31.493
Platsebolar, hatto adrenalin kabi 
stress gormonlarini

00:03:31.493 --> 00:03:32.974
kamaytirishi

00:03:32.974 --> 00:03:35.995
bu esa kasallikning zararli 
ta'sirini zaiflashtirishi mumkin.

00:03:35.995 --> 00:03:39.954
Shunday ekan g’ayrioddiy platsebo 
effektiga tasannolar aytmaymizmi?

00:03:39.954 --> 00:03:41.439
Xulosa chiqarishga shoshilmang.

00:03:41.439 --> 00:03:43.975
Agar bemor uni sohta eliksir 
oyoqqa turg'azganiga

00:03:43.975 --> 00:03:48.586
ishonsa, u foyda berishi aniq bo’lgan 
dori va muolajani ortga surishi mumkin.

00:03:48.586 --> 00:03:51.774
Qolaversa, bu ijobiy ta'sirlar vaqt 
o'tishi bilan so'nishi mumkin

00:03:51.774 --> 00:03:53.503
va ko’pincha shunday bo’ladi.

00:03:53.503 --> 00:03:55.735
Platsebolar tibbiy natijalarga ham shubha

00:03:55.735 --> 00:03:58.821
uyg’otadi, bu olimlarni uning
bizga ko'rsatayotgan ta'sirini

00:03:58.821 --> 00:04:01.491
chuqurroq o’rganishga undaydi.